[version]
1.5.3
[date]
2026-10-21
[whatsnew]
- FIXED: Close button (X) now works!
  - Button positions were misaligned: X was drawn at width-2 but
    onCloseButton checked width-1. Also MaxButton overlapped Close.
  - Fixed: X at width-1, M at width-2, _ at width-3 (all 1 char each)
  - All three buttons (minimize/maximize/close) now respond correctly
- IMPROVED: Update with floppy disk support
  - When disk space is low, updater now:
    1. Checks for attached disk drive with floppy disk
    2. If found: copies old files to /disk/update-backup/ then deletes them
    3. If no disk: deletes old files directly (no backup)
    4. Downloads new files into freed space
  - This means updates work even with very little free disk space
  - Old files on floppy can be manually restored if update fails
[/whatsnew]
[files]
de/gui.lua
sbin/updater.lua
latest_update.upd
[/files]
